# New Domain Checklist

When adding a new domain `<domain>` (e.g., `orders`, `reports`, `users`):

## 1. Create domain folder

```
backend/app/<domain>/
  __init__.py
  db_models.py         # ORM models
  domain.py            # Request Pydantic models
  dto.py               # Response Pydantic models
  api/
    __init__.py
    routes.py          # FastAPI router with DishkaRoute
    index.md
  usecases/
    __init__.py
    get_<domain>_usecase.py
    create_<domain>_usecase.py
    # add upload_<domain>_file_usecase.py if files needed
    index.md
  index.md
```

## 2. Register ORM models for migrations

In `backend/migrations/env.py`:
```python
from backend.app.<domain>.db_models import <Domain>Model  # noqa: F401
```

Then: `just db-create-migration "add <domain> tables"` + `just db-migrate`

## 3. Create Dishka provider

Create `backend/shared/di/providers/<domain>.py`:
```python
from dishka import Provider, Scope, provide
from backend.app.<domain>.usecases.create_<domain>_usecase import Create<Domain>UseCase

class <Domain>Provider(Provider):
    scope = Scope.REQUEST
    create_<domain> = provide(Create<Domain>UseCase)
```

Add to `backend/shared/di/providers/provider.py`:
```python
from backend.shared.di.providers.<domain> import <Domain>Provider
ALL_PROVIDERS = [..., <Domain>Provider()]
```

## 4. Register API router

In `backend/app/api/router.py`:
```python
from backend.app.<domain>.api.routes import router as <domain>_router
api_router.include_router(<domain>_router)
```

## 5. Add Kafka topics (if files involved)

In `shared/kafka_streams/topics.py` — add upload/delete topics.  
In `subscribers/s3.py` — add `@kafka_subscriber` handlers.  
In `subscribers/__init__.py` — import new subscriber module.

## 6. Add Builder methods

In `backend/tests/builder.py`:
```python
async def build_<domain>(self, *, field: str = "default") -> <Domain>Model:
    ...
```

## 7. Create test folder

```
backend/tests/<domain>/
  __init__.py
  test_api_get_<domain>.py
  test_api_create_<domain>.py
  test_upload_<domain>_file_usecase.py  # if files
```

## 8. Verify everything works

```bash
just db-migrate
just lint
just test
```
